    {
      "text": "It is thought that Conkeldurr taught humans how to make concrete more than 2,000 years ago.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Concrete mixed by Conkeldurr is much more durable than normal concrete, even when the compositions of the two materials are the same.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "When going all out, this Pokémon throws aside its concrete pillars and leaps at opponents to pummel them with its fists.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
